"""TASK 096 bounded PythonAnywhere controller.

Owner-authorized scope:
BACKUP -> SANDBOX -> CANARY -> REPORT only.

The live CRM is opened via SQLite URI mode=ro and PRAGMA query_only=ON.  The
only remote writes are beneath:
/home/Carix/autopilot_inbox/cloud/task_096_tech_spec_ai_crm/

